# MixQ Release Notes

## 0.0.3 (17 Apr 2026)

* Fix: playlist dropdown now populates correctly — `result` is a reserved AppleScript
  keyword; renaming the variable to `joinedNames` was the actual root cause fix
* Fix: playlists with apostrophes (e.g. "70's") now load tracks correctly
* Refactor: playlist name passed to AppleScript as argv rather than embedded in script
* Feature: loading a new playlist now clears the Music app's Up Next queue

## 0.0.2 (17 Apr 2026)

* Fix: playlist names containing apostrophes now load correctly
* Fix: playlist dropdown no longer mangles names with commas or special characters (switched to `|||` delimiter in AppleScript output)
* Remove stale `shlex` import that was incorrectly applied to AppleScript strings

## 0.0.1 (31 Jan 2026)

* Initial release
